      "reasons": [
        "The claim that “IPPA usually refers to … IPPA–Revised (IPPA-R)” is not supported by the packet, which specifically names “Inventory of Parent and Peer Attachment–Revised (IPPA-R)” rather than establishing the “usually refers to” framing for “IPPA.”",
